{"c":[{"id":"569740c12f8fdab5","sum":"W3: client setCodeSigningRequirement blocks what it receives, not its first call; XPCHostLink sends nothing until a verified reply. Memory is markdown: MemoryStore(dir) uses <dir>/Memory; main.ts uses the real folder only without --data-dir.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T204321Z-a08d2817ff5ece3d","text":"W3: NSXPCConnection.setCodeSigningRequirement on the client blocks what it receives, not its own first call; whoever owns the Mach name sees open's arguments, so XPCHostLink sends nothing until a verified reply.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T204904Z-98cc6d5ebfceb30a","text":"Personal memory is markdown (helper/src/memory): MemoryStore(dir) keeps it in <dir>/Memory unless told otherwise, and main.ts uses ~/Library/Application Support/Caret/Memory only when --data-dir is not given, so tests and evals never open the real folder.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"6e639a4926698b7e","sum":"Memory markdown grants no authority (permissions, onItsOwn, hand-off stay in memory.sqlite); editing a skill file puts it back on Tab (SkillJson.fileDigest). oxc rejects a raw U+2028/U+2029 in a regex literal; write the \\u2028 escape (Write tools may unescape it).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T204920Z-024f4219fb18c6cf","text":"Memory markdown grants no authority: permissions and a skill's onItsOwn, clean runs and hand-off stay in memory.sqlite; editing a skill's file puts it back on Tab, and SkillJson.fileDigest catches edits made while Caret was stopped.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T204920Z-0ba29fff62387456","text":"vite's oxc parser rejects a regex literal holding a raw U+2028/U+2029 (a line terminator); write the \\u2028 escape. An agent's Write tool can turn the escape into the raw character.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
